    "en": {
      "trackName": "Games For Watch:No Wifi Games",
      "description": "90+ games for iPhone and Apple Watch\n\nGames For Watch brings arcade classics, puzzles, racing and tabletop games together in one collection. Reel in a gold nugget from your wrist while you wait for the bus, fit in a round of Fruit Slice at lunch, or pass your iPhone back and forth for a game of tic-tac-toe.\n\nPuzzles & mazes\nDaily Sudoku · Sudoku · Capy Garden · Minesweeper · Word Foundations · Sky Tangram · Hex Mosaic · 15 Puzzle · One Line Drawing · One Stroke 2 · Wooden Threads · Rotate Rings · Arrow Trails · Timber Slide · Pipe Garden · Maze · Color Maze · Rolling Maze · Gecko Paths · Apple Worm · Catch the Kitten · Cat Box · Cat Bridge\n\nSorting games\nBus Sort · Bird Sort · Fish Rescue · Goods Sort · Water Sort · Magic Water Sort\n\nMatch & merge\nSugar Match · Triple Tiles · Jade Pairs · Link Game · Aurora Bubbles · Fruit Parade · Gem Art Puzzle · Sand Mosaic · Pop Star · Hex Escape · Block Blast · Falling Blocks · 2048 · 2248 · NumMerge · Number Orbs · Coin Merge · Fruit Merge\n\nArcade games\nGold Miner · Garden Snake · Globe Serpent · Fruit Slice · Brick Breaker · Prism Bounce · Neon Ring Escape · Pellet Maze · Star Wings · Meadow Squad · Ocean Salvo · Meadow Moles · Balloon Guard · Bath Bubble Brawl · Flappy Cat · Timber Tower · Kitten Pinball · Sleepy Cat · Capy Spiral\n\nRacing & platformers\nCanyon Rally · Ski Rush · Ski Rush 2 · Marble Dash · Terrace Hop · Bounce Trail · Ninja Leap · Cloud Strider · Duck Trails · Stack Bird · Cat Parkour · Paper Territory\n\nBoard & card games\nChess · Chinese Chess · Gomoku · Animal Rivals · Tic Tac Toe · Tic Tac Toe Pro · Spider Solitaire · Landlord Cards\n\nSports & aiming games\nPocket Pool · Velvet Snooker · Sky Dunk · Bang~\n\nTurn the Digital Crown to steer, aim or zoom in supported Apple Watch games. Save your favorites for easy access next time. Local games are playable offline.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://reboxgame.github.io/WathGames/privacy.html\nTerms of Use: https://reboxgame.github.io/WathGames/term.html",
      "releaseNotes": "• Added new games for more ways to play.\n• Fixed known issues for a smoother gaming experience.",
